# HTML report

Use when the user asks for a report, a readout, or an HTML plan.

Read `Plugin/awesome-ds/skills/html-report/SKILL.md` and follow it. One HTML file. White canvas, dark text, AwesomeDS tokens. Conclusion in three sentences, then one table or one figure. Do not build a React app and do not add a page to the AwesomeDS site. Check the file with `node Plugin/awesome-ds/skills/html-report/scripts/check-report.mjs <file>`.
